{
  "description": "This protocol performs mastermix and DNA sample transfer to a custom 384-well plate. All DNA samples are transferred in quadruplicate in adjacent wells forming 2x2 well squares on the 384-well plate (12x8 squares mapping to the 12x8 input from the 96-well DNA plate), as in the following image:  \n\n\n\n\nMicroAmp Optical 384-well plate\nUSA Scientific 96 Well Plate 100 µL\nCustom single-channel reservoir 25ml (will span slots 4 and 1)\nOpentrons P10 multi-channel GEN1 pipette\nOpentrons 10µl tiprack",
  "tags": [
    "cnv.ot2.apiv2.py",
    "PCR",
    "PCR Prep"
  ],
  "workflow": [
